 * @param toolCalls - The actual tool calls made
 * @returns true if any call to the tool has exactly matching arguments
 *
 * @example
 * matchToolCallWithArgs('add', {a: 2, b: 3}, toolCalls) // true if add({a:2, b:3}) was called
